# 2. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Build a fully automated local system capable of collecting car rental agency information across **all 69 Algerian wilayas**.

The system must collect as much legitimate, publicly available information as possible, while respecting source restrictions and avoiding excessive runtime.

Each agency record should contain:

- Business name.
- Business name in Arabic, when available.
- Business name in French, when available.
- Business name in English, when available.
- Primary Algerian phone number.
- Additional phone numbers.
- Full address.
- Commune.
- Wilaya.
- Wilaya code.
- GPS latitude.
- GPS longitude.
- Website.
- Facebook page.
- Instagram page.
- Other public social media links.
- Google Maps URL, if legitimately available.
- Source name.
- Original source URL.
- Collection date.
- Last verification date.
- Verification status.
- Confidence score.
- Additional notes.

Never invent missing information. Empty fields must remain empty.

The system must preserve the origin of information and distinguish collected facts from inferred or normalized values.

